{"id": "218958", "name": "התפלגות Y = X² עבור X מעריכי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "fr", "params": ["u"], "body": "if integerp(u) then string(u) else sconcat(\"\\\\frac{\",num(u),\"}{\",denom(u),\"}\")"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( X\\sim\\operatorname{Exp}\\left({{CT:0}}\\right) \\)</span> ונגדיר משתנה חדש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y=X^2\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>איזו מהטענות הבאות בהכרח נכונה?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">פונקציית ההתפלגות</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y=X^2\\geq 0\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F_Y(t)=0\\)</span> כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\lt 0\\)</span>. כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\geq 0\\)</span>, מאחר ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\geq 0\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F_Y(t)=\\mathbb{P}[X^2\\leq t]=\\mathbb{P}\\left[X\\leq\\sqrt t\\right]=1-e^{-[[if test=\"{{CT:1}}\"]][[else]]{{CT:0}}[[/if]]\\sqrt{t}} \\]</p>זו אינה פונקציית התפלגות מעריכית (שם המעריך לינארי ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\)</span>). התשובה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F_Y(t)=\\begin{cases} 1-e^{-[[if test=\"{{CT:1}}\"]][[else]]{{CT:0}}[[/if]]\\sqrt{t}} &amp; t\\geq0 \\\\ 0 &amp; t\\lt 0 \\end{cases} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "checkbox", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "LaTeXdisplaystyle"}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "mcq_correct(ta)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["la", "o1", "o2", "o3", "o4", "q", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}